No upstream source code or binary is vendored in Git. On x86_64, setup downloads
official release archives. On Android ARM64/Termux, it downloads and verifies a
precompiled aarch64-linux-android package built by this repository's GitHub
Actions workflow from the pinned upstream tag and Android NDK.
